---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility | Trouvus" description="The Trouvus commitment to an accessible and inclusive digital experience.">
  <Hero eyebrow="Accessibility" title="Access should be built in." lead="Trouvus is committed to an inclusive website experience and continuous improvement." variant="waves" />
  <section><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>We aim to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA where reasonably possible.</p>
    <h2>Measures in this website</h2>
    <ul><li>Keyboard-accessible navigation and visible focus indicators.</li><li>A skip link and semantic page landmarks.</li><li>Responsive layouts, scalable text and labelled form controls.</li><li>Alternative text for meaningful graphics.</li><li>Reduced-motion support for visitors who request it.</li></ul>
    <h2>Feedback and alternative formats</h2>
    <p>If you encounter a barrier or need information in another format, email <a href="mailto:info@trouvus.com">info@trouvus.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+14165785353">+1 (416) 578-5353</a>. Please describe the page and the assistance you need.</p>
    <h2>Assessment status</h2>
    <p>This private-preview build has undergone automated and keyboard-focused checks. A complete screen-reader and user assessment is scheduled before public launch.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
